--[[
    WindUI v1.6.66 - Ye Performance Build
    Base library: Footagesus/WindUI (MIT)
    Official release pinned: v1.6.66

    Performance changes:
    1. Cache the official WindUI source locally.
    2. Cache all six remote icon packs in NightHub_Cache/WindUI_Icons.
    3. Debounce Squircle AbsoluteSize recalculation.
    4. Lazy-create unused Highlight / Hover decoration layers.
    5. Batch NewElements shape refreshes during mass control creation.
    6. Batch Tab CanvasSize updates.
    7. Keep the window root at a stable size during Open / Close.
       Only animate the lightweight background shell + transparency.
    8. Apply SetSize / fullscreen size / UIScale in one step instead of
       tweening the whole UI tree through many intermediate sizes.

    This file intentionally pins WindUI 1.6.66 because the patches below
    match that release's compiled source structure.
]]

